"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-KMEE%2Fkmee--odoo--addons-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/tree/20.0/crm_wip\n"
"    :alt: KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"This module extends Odoo's CRM functionality by adding Work in Progress\n"
"(WIP) features to opportunities. It allows tracking and managing\n"
"opportunities that are actively being worked on, helping sales teams\n"
"better organize their pipeline and prioritize their work.\n"
"\n"
"Key features:\n"
"\n"
"- WIP status tracking for opportunities\n"
"- Visual indicators for opportunities in progress\n"
"- Enhanced opportunity management workflow\n"
"- Integration with standard CRM features\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Use Cases / Context\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"This module was developed to address the need for better tracking of\n"
"active work on opportunities in the sales pipeline. It helps sales\n"
"teams:\n"
"\n"
"- Identify which opportunities are currently being worked on\n"
"- Improve pipeline visibility and management\n"
"- Reduce overlap in sales team efforts\n"
"- Better organize and prioritize sales activities\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To configure this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to Settings > Users & Companies > Users\n"
"2. Select the user(s) that should have access to WIP features\n"
"3. Under Access Rights tab, ensure they have proper CRM access rights\n"
"4. The WIP features will be automatically available in the CRM pipeline\n"
"   view\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module:\n"
"\n"
"1. Navigate to CRM > Pipeline\n"
"2. Select an opportunity\n"
"3. In the opportunity form, you'll find the WIP status field\n"
"4. Toggle the WIP status to indicate when you're actively working on the\n"
"   opportunity\n"
"5. Use the pipeline view to easily identify opportunities in progress\n"
"\n"
"The WIP status helps track which opportunities are being actively worked\n"
"on, improving pipeline management and team coordination.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/issues/new?body=module:%20crm_wip%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
